  - Id: 10
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: "Duman alg\u0131land\u0131"
      TurkishBody: "Alan\u0131 kontrol edin ve g\xFCvenlik talimatlar\u0131n\u0131
        uygulay\u0131n."
      EnglishTitle: Smoke detected
      EnglishBody: Check the area and follow safety instructions.
